Text: Multi-task Learning A collection of improved models (Chen and Cardie, 2018; Chen et al., 2018; Liu et al., 2019) are developed based on multi- task learning. Especially, shared-private model, as a popular multi-task learning model, divides the features of different tasks into private and shared spaces, where shared features, i.e., task-irrelevant features in shared space, as supplementary fea- tures are used for different tasks.

