=== Generated Answer (model draft; check against evidence) ===
The multi-task learning setup is based on a shared-private model with a 4-level hierarchical structure, in which a selected sharing layer filters the original outputs of the shared layer [4]. The model uses transformer encoders in its shared-private feature extractor and attention sharing cell [3][11], input embeddings with position embeddings [1], and a final output layer that applies softmax to each task using the concatenation of private features and selected sharing layer outputs [8]. The selected sharing layer uses a single gate mechanism to filter useless shared features and an attention mechanism to focus on features helpful to the target tasks [2]. Experiments are conducted on RumourEval and PHEME with 5-fold cross-validation after holding out 10% for tuning [9][12].
